{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 44, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "Hark good traveler of noble intent to Japan’s fair isle\nwhere cherry blossoms dance with zephyrs light\nbehold thy voyage’s map most splendid and wise.\n\nUpon the morn of thine embarkation\nset forth to Tokyo fair with heart full of glee\nwhere neon lanterns burn with golden hue\nand ancient shrines do whisper secrets old.\n\nUpon thy first day mark the token of the\nTōkyō Station grand with arches tall\nthen wander forth to Shinjuku’s bright streets\nwhere cabarets hum and love’s tales unfold.\n\nLet thy second morn find thee in Asakusa’s glow\nwhere Senso-ji’s gates do stand so wide\npray to the gods and offer thy prayers\nthen feast upon tempura’s crisp embrace.\n\nOn the third day let thy spirit take flight\nto Nikko’s forests where kami do dwell\nsee the Toshogu’s splendor carved in gold\nand mossy paths that lead to heaven’s gate.\n\nThou shalt then journey forth to Hakone’s embrace\nwhere hot springs do stir the weary bones\nbehold Mount Fuji in his snowy crown\nand onsen’s steam that cleanseth soul anew.\n\nOn the fourth day let Kyoto’s lanes call thy name\nwhere geisha’s steps are soft and discreet\nvisit Kinkaku-ji with mirror so bright\nthen wander Gion where willow branches sway.\n\nLet thy fifth morn dawn with Arashiyama’s grace\nwhere bamboo groves do bend in humble grace\nthen sail upon the river’s gentle tide\nand through Fushimi’s sake yeast teem with life.\n\nOn the sixth day let Nara’s deer thy guide\nas they prance with bells upon their necks\nsee Todai-ji’s Buddha so grand and wise\nthen let thy heart be filled with ancient lore.\n\nReturn thou to Osaka’s bustling den\nwhere takoyaki’s bubbles rise in cheer\nand Dotonbori’s lights do paint the night\nwith flavors bold and joy that fills the air.\n\nUpon thy seventh day make haste to Hiroshima’s shore\nwhere peace doth bloom in Park of Memory’s keep\nthen to Miyajima where torii emerges\nfrom Seto’s waters deep and soft as sleep.\n\nThy eighth day let Hiroshima’s heart still thy pace\nwhere history’s weight doth press upon thy breast\nyet hope doth bloom where children play with crane\nand souls find solace in the morning’s light.\n\nNow let thy final morn find thee in Kanazawa’s keep\nwhere samurai’s homes stand in quiet grace\nthen to Takayama’s streets where time moves slow\nand sake is poured in earthenware embrace.\n\nUpon thy last day before return to thy home\nlet Kyoto’s temples one final time behold\nthen with heavy heart but spirit filled with fire\ndepart from Japan’s shores with love untold.\n\nFair traveler rest in thy dreams of the land\nwhere gods and mortals walk hand in hand.", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.1340528428554535}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -0.004188099876046181}, {"token": " good", "logprob": -2.0668089389801025}, {"token": " travel", "logprob": -0.5146529674530029}, {"token": "er", "logprob": -0.0005768066039308906}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -2.154557466506958}, {"token": " noble", "logprob": -2.1622045040130615}, {"token": " intent", "logprob": -1.5701037645339966}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -2.6279237270355225}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.4960976243019104}, {"token": "’s", "logprob": -0.3313341438770294}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -0.1676470786333084}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -1.6355093717575073}, {"token": "le", "logprob": -0.31344038248062134}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -3.568253993988037}, {"token": "where", "logprob": -2.642254590988159}, {"token": " cherry", "logprob": -0.3842741847038269}, {"token": " bloss", "logprob": -0.2797633409500122}, {"token": "oms", "logprob": -0.007771849632263184}, {"token": " dance", "logprob": -1.3947033882141113}, {"token": " with", "logprob": -1.5246998071670532}, {"token": " ze", "logprob": -0.5695096850395203}, {"token": "phyr", "logprob": -0.002409295178949833}, {"token": "s", "logprob": -0.5541348457336426}, {"token": " li